                                                "sense_id": "f960959f-c948-3a3e-a4ec-d43caccd1e5e",
                                                "text": "New vehicles will cut emissions by 5.3 megatonnes by 2010 as part of Ottawa's plans to meet Canada's Kyoto targets."
                                            },
                                            {
