                                                "sense_id": "f960959f-c948-3a3e-a4ec-d43caccd1e5e",
                                                "text": "Ottawa announced the mission in Afghanistan will have a greater focus on reconstruction, development and security training, with an increase in aid of more than a half a billion dollars."
                                            }
